## Interface: 30300
## Title: PicoID
## Notes: Lists the procs imprinted on your equipped items with their IDs and item of origin. Companion to SchoolPop's InvID.
## Author: Michael
## Version: 1.14
## SavedVariables: PicoIDDB, PicoIDExport
## OptionalDeps: SchoolPop

# ⚠ PicoID_ProcDB.lua and PicoID_DropDB.lua are NOT listed here on purpose. They
# are 810 KB of table literals and now live in the PicoIDData addon, which is
# ## LoadOnDemand and is pulled in by EnsureData() the first time anything reads
# them. Adding them back here reinstates an 810 KB parse at every login for every
# player, including everyone who never opens the window.
PicoID.lua
